      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_17281589_0610&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_17281589_0610.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_17282302_0611&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_17282302_0611.jpg&#34;&gt;From: Harold G., To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Peoria, Ill. on September 4, 1912&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess M. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Ill.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Bessie&lt;br&gt;
How are you making it by this time? I have been to school 1 1/2 day. Have two teachers. I take 4 studies. English, Latin, Algebra, and Physics. George says they give lessons here.&lt;br&gt;
Harold G.&lt;br&gt;
135 Rock Stand Ave.&lt;br&gt;
Peoria, Ill.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
